</article-title><source>Clin Ther</source><year>2005</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>1752</fpage><lpage>1763</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16368446</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boulet</surname><given-names>LP</given-names></name><name><surname>Drollmann</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Magyar</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Timar</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Knight</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Engelstatter</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Fabbri</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparative efficacy of once-daily ciclesonide and budesonide in the treatment of persistent asthma</article-title><source>Respir Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>100</volume><fpage>785</fpage><lpage>794</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16427266</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Buhl</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Vinkler</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Magyar</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Gyori</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Rybacki</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Middle</surname><given-names>MV</given-names></name><name><surname>Escher</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Engelstatter</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparable efficacy of ciclesonide once daily versus fluticasone propionate twice daily in asthma</article-title><source>Pulm Pharmacol Ther</source><year>2006</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>404</fpage><lpage>412</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16310388</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></ar